# Gemini API key for J.A.R.V.I.S. (aistudio.google.com/apikey — use a project
# WITHOUT billing so usage stays on the free tier and can never cost money).
# Used only on the server: the Netlify Functions in netlify/functions, the
# local dev API (`npm run dev`), evals and brief recording. Never prefix it
# with NEXT_PUBLIC_ — that would ship it to every visitor.
#
# Locally: copy this file to .env. On Netlify: Site configuration →
# Environment variables, with the "Functions" scope (Builds isn't needed).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
